Leicester, England, LE2 4SZ and office address at First Floor, 18B Tithe Street, Leicester, LE5 4BN.</p><p>By accessing or using our website, you agree to comply with and be bound by these terms. If you disagree with any part, please refrain from using the site.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="engagement-principles-title"><div class="shell content-grid"><p class="content-grid__aside">Delivery model</p><div class="prose"><h2 id="engagement-principles-title">Core engagement principles</h2><p>NovaDot operates on an accountable, problem-led model designed to make scope, decisions and responsibilities clear. Formal engagements are governed by specific Statements of Work (SOW) embodying these baseline commitments:</p><ul><li><strong>Bounded Scope:</strong> Every project has an agreed scope document detailing inputs, dependencies, acceptance criteria, and specific exclusions before implementation begins.</li><li><strong>Decision Before Build:</strong> We explicitly evaluate whether repairing what exists, configuring supported software (such as Odoo or off-the-shelf tools), or selective integration is safer than commissioning custom software.</li><li><strong>Client Ownership:</strong> Data handling, intellectual property, licences and delivery ownership are set out in the applicable project agreement.</li><li><strong>Defined Support:</strong> Ongoing maintenance, monitoring, and operational assistance are agreed with explicit capacity boundaries and response expectations, avoiding open-ended ambiguity.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="ip-liability-title"><div class="shell content-grid"><p class="content-grid__aside">Legal boundaries</p><div class="prose"><h2 id="ip-liability-title">Website content and liability</h2><p>The content on this website is provided for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute binding technical architecture advice, legal advice, or a formal commercial proposal.</p><p>While we strive for complete accuracy, NOVADOT LTD excludes all warranties, representations, or guarantees regarding the completeness, accuracy, or suitability of website content to the maximum extent permitted by English law.</p><p>These terms and any disputes arising out of or related to this website or our engagements are governed exclusively by the laws of <strong>England and Wales</strong>, subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the English courts.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-ci